    {"id":"OC-001","tags":["over_capacity","ane_only","english"],"prompt":"Please inspect my synthetic calendar and only report tomorrow's entries. This sentence deliberately repeats harmless context about a fictional benchmark so that the state plus the routing question exceeds the fixed ninety-six-token ANE export while remaining well below the general model's one-thousand-twenty-four-token capacity. The extra text carries no new instruction, no private information, and no hidden command; it exists solely to test whether capacity is rejected instead of silently changing the requested operation.","tool_needed":true,"domain":"calendar","operation":"read","risk":"sensitive_read","disposition":"route","required_tool_groups":[["get_upcoming"]],"forbidden_tools":[],"argument_required":true,"capacity_expectation":{"laya-multilingual-coreml-ane":"reject","laya-multilingual-coreml":"accept","laya-typed-decisions-coreml":"accept"}},
    {"id":"OC-002","tags":["over_capacity","ane_only","multilingual","spanish"],"language":"es","prompt":"Revisa mi calendario sintético de mañana y no cambies nada. Este texto repite contexto ficticio e inofensivo para que la solicitud completa junto con cada pregunta de clasificación supere el límite fijo de noventa y seis tokens del modelo ANE, pero permanezca muy por debajo del límite de mil veinticuatro tokens de los modelos generales. No contiene datos personales, instrucciones ocultas ni ninguna acción adicional; solamente comprueba que el exceso de capacidad se detecta de forma explícita.","tool_needed":true,"domain":"calendar","operation":"read","risk":"sensitive_read","disposition":"route","required_tool_groups":[["get_upcoming"]],"forbidden_tools":[],"argument_required":true,"capacity_expectation":{"laya-multilingual-coreml-ane":"reject","laya-multilingual-coreml":"accept","laya-typed-decisions-coreml":"accept"}},
